{"correlation_id": "97769990-7c38-41cd-ae6d-a234ecbde324", "event": "final_received", "final": {"answer": "A residential lease agreement is a legal contract outlining the terms between a landlord and tenant. It defines the rental property, specifies the rental period and amount, and details rights and responsibilities for both parties.", "correlation_id": "97769990-7c38-41cd-ae6d-a234ecbde324", "draft": "A residential lease agreement is a legal contract outlining the terms between a landlord and tenant. It defines the rental property, specifies the rental period and amount, and details rights and responsibilities for both parties.", "from_stage": "reviewer", "input_source": {"offset": 41, "partition": 0, "topic": "s6102_drafts"}, "plan": "A residential lease agreement is a legal contract between a landlord and a tenant that outlines the terms and conditions of renting a property. Here are three key steps:\n\n1. It defines the rental property, including its address and basic details.\n2. It specifies the rental period and rent amount.\n3. It details rights and responsibilities of both the landlord and tenant.", "question": "What is a residential lease agreement?", "rental_context": {"data_version": 12, "dataset_id": "0e586d72da6211f1ae011ab4cc3919df", "listings": [], "requested_codes": []}, "run_id": "question-97769990-7c38-41cd-ae6d-a234ecbde324", "status": "approved", "writer_instance": "writer-7100"}, "offset": 41, "partition": 0, "pid": 8587, "run_id": "question-97769990-7c38-41cd-ae6d-a234ecbde324", "source_commit": "52c8ef470b124605a0fc51dd8c5821b4a5f3738b", "student": "Pragya Apurva", "timestamp": "2026-11-07T04:28:10.173304+00:00", "topic": "s6102_final"}
