{"correlation_id": "7e459aac-6fbd-4781-8147-d953ea03ad2b", "event": "final_received", "final": {"answer": "The rental application is used to screen potential tenants and gather necessary information before renting out a property. It typically includes details about the applicant's income, employment, credit history, and previous rental experience to ensure the tenant will be responsible and able to pay rent on time.", "correlation_id": "7e459aac-6fbd-4781-8147-d953ea03ad2b", "draft": "A rental application is used to screen potential tenants and gather necessary information before renting out a property. It typically includes details about the applicant's income, employment, credit history, and previous rental experience to ensure the tenant will be responsible and able to pay rent on time.", "from_stage": "reviewer", "input_source": {"offset": 47, "partition": 0, "topic": "s6102_drafts"}, "plan": "A rental application is used to screen potential tenants and gather necessary information before renting out a property. It typically includes details about the applicant's income, employment, credit history, and previous rental experience to ensure the tenant will be responsible and able to pay rent on time.", "question": "What is a rental application used for?", "rental_context": {"data_version": 12, "dataset_id": "0e586d72da6211f1ae011ab4cc3919df", "listings": [], "requested_codes": []}, "run_id": "question-7e459aac-6fbd-4781-8147-d953ea03ad2b", "status": "approved", "writer_instance": "writer-7100"}, "offset": 47, "partition": 0, "pid": 8587, "run_id": "question-7e459aac-6fbd-4781-8147-d953ea03ad2b", "source_commit": "52c8ef470b124605a0fc51dd8c5821b4a5f3738b", "student": "Pragya Apurva", "timestamp": "2026-11-07T04:29:50.139533+00:00", "topic": "s6102_final"}
