{"correlation_id": "c68acfcc-38b8-44b5-aa59-c0ac6df043f9", "event": "final_received", "final": {"answer": "The draft is clear and accurate. Here is the final answer:\n\nA month-to-month tenancy is a rental agreement that continues from month to month without a fixed end date. Tenants and landlords can typically terminate the agreement by providing a notice period, usually one month. This type of tenancy offers flexibility but may come with specific terms outlined in the lease agreement.", "correlation_id": "c68acfcc-38b8-44b5-aa59-c0ac6df043f9", "draft": "A month-to-month tenancy is a rental agreement that continues from month to month without a fixed end date. Tenants and landlords can typically terminate the agreement by providing a notice period, usually one month. This type of tenancy offers flexibility but may come with specific terms outlined in the lease agreement.", "from_stage": "reviewer", "input_source": {"offset": 48, "partition": 0, "topic": "s6102_drafts"}, "plan": "A month-to-month tenancy is a rental agreement that continues from month to month without a fixed end date. Tenants and landlords can typically terminate the agreement by providing a notice period, usually one month. This type of tenancy offers flexibility but may come with specific terms outlined in the lease agreement.", "question": "Define a month-to-month tenancy.", "rental_context": {"data_version": 12, "dataset_id": "0e586d72da6211f1ae011ab4cc3919df", "listings": [], "requested_codes": []}, "run_id": "question-c68acfcc-38b8-44b5-aa59-c0ac6df043f9", "status": "approved", "writer_instance": "writer-7100"}, "offset": 48, "partition": 0, "pid": 8587, "run_id": "question-c68acfcc-38b8-44b5-aa59-c0ac6df043f9", "source_commit": "52c8ef470b124605a0fc51dd8c5821b4a5f3738b", "student": "Pragya Apurva", "timestamp": "2026-11-07T04:30:08.923401+00:00", "topic": "s6102_final"}
