{"correlation_id": "23c5421c-aae3-4514-955c-f08552ed7bd3", "event": "final_received", "final": {"answer": "A maintenance request in a rental property is a formal way for tenants to report needed repairs or improvements to the landlord or property management. Tenants typically submit these requests through a designated process, such as an online form or by contacting management directly. The landlord then addresses and schedules the necessary maintenance work.", "correlation_id": "23c5421c-aae3-4514-955c-f08552ed7bd3", "draft": "A maintenance request in a rental property is a formal way for tenants to report needed repairs or improvements to the landlord or property management. Tenants typically submit these requests through a designated process, such as an online form or by contacting management directly. The landlord then addresses and schedules the necessary maintenance work.", "from_stage": "reviewer", "input_source": {"offset": 49, "partition": 0, "topic": "s6102_drafts"}, "plan": "A maintenance request in a rental property is a formal way for tenants to report needed repairs or improvements to the landlord or property management. Tenants typically submit these requests through a designated process, such as an online form or by contacting the management directly. The landlord then addresses and schedules the necessary maintenance work.", "question": "What is a maintenance request in a rental property?", "rental_context": {"data_version": 12, "dataset_id": "0e586d72da6211f1ae011ab4cc3919df", "listings": [], "requested_codes": []}, "run_id": "question-23c5421c-aae3-4514-955c-f08552ed7bd3", "status": "approved", "writer_instance": "writer-7100"}, "offset": 49, "partition": 0, "pid": 8587, "run_id": "question-23c5421c-aae3-4514-955c-f08552ed7bd3", "source_commit": "52c8ef470b124605a0fc51dd8c5821b4a5f3738b", "student": "Pragya Apurva", "timestamp": "2026-11-07T04:30:26.562677+00:00", "topic": "s6102_final"}
